    "Profundidad (m)": "M1:1-1,5\n M2:2-2,5\n M3:3-3,5\n M4:3,5-4\n M5:4,5-5\n M6:5,5-6\n M7:6,5-7\n M8:7.5-8\n M9:8-8,5\n M10:8,5-9\n M11:9-10\n M12:10-10,3\n M13:10,3-11\n M14:11-12\n M15:12-13\n M16:13-14\n M17:14-15\n M18:15-16\n M19:16-17\n M20:17-18\n M21:18-19\n M22:19-20\n M23:20-21\n M24:21-22\n M25:22-23\n M26:23-24\n M27:24-25",
